{
  "path": "lua/ge/extensions/gameplay/missions/missionTypes/editorHelper.lua",
  "module": "Base class for writing the editor of a mission type in the game's editor (imgui interface). A mission type declares its missionTypeData fields with addXxx methods (number, text, boolean, 3D transform, vehicle model/config, file, race, leaderboard, dropdown...); the helper can then provide the default values (getNewData), load a mission (setMission), check its fields (checkMission), draw the widgets and the 3D gizmos (draw). The module returns a factory `function(derivedClass, ...)` that creates the object, copies the keys of the derived class, initializes elements and autoAdditionalAttributes then calls init() if it exists.",
  "usage": "-- editor.lua of a mission type (old style)\nlocal C = {}\nfunction C:init()\n  self:addNumeric('Laps', 'laps', 3)\n  self:addTransform('Start', 'start', {hasScl=false}, {drawMode='vehicle'})\nend\nreturn function() return gameplay_missions_missions.editorHelper(C) end",
  "notes": [
    "Each element is a table {type, label, fieldName, displayOptions, ...}. addElement gives them a unique _id and converts displayOptions.associatedStars (string) into a table {key=true}.",
    "A multi-field element writes several keys in missionTypeData: transform -> <fieldName>Pos / Rot / Scl; modelconfig -> <fieldName>Model / Config / ConfigPath; leaderboard -> <fieldName>BestResult / MediumResult / WorstResult (and Count on the interface side).",
    "Severities of checkMission problems: \"error\" for a missing field, different type or model/config/file not found; \"warning\" for an extra field (fixable = true).",
    "Bug: newDataFunctions.reward and newDataFunctions.simpleLapConfig equal `defaultValue`, a variable undefined at this point (nil): these two types therefore have no default value in getNewData nor a check in checkMission (treated as nop). SetMission functions exist for them.",
    "Bug: missionIdSetMission reads `mtd.value` instead of `mtd[e.fieldName]`: a missionId field is never reloaded from the mission.",
    "The colors defaultColors.default / orange / red are built with 5 components (e.g. ImVec4(1,0.6,0,8,0.75)), a sign of a typo (0.8 expected); only the first 4 are taken into account.",
    "gameplay_missions_missions.editorHelper(C, ...) does not return this file but editor/util/editorElementHelper (context 'mission'); this module is only used by direct calls (e.g. editor/missionEditor/genericTypeData.lua)."
  ],
  "classes": {
    "C": {
      "desc": "Mission type editor class. Instance fields: elements (ordered list), autoAdditionalAttributes, mission (mission being edited), mouseInfo (mouse state for the gizmos).",
      "functions": {
        "addElement": {
          "desc": "Adds an already built element to the list (assigns _id, normalizes displayOptions). All addXxx methods go through it and return the element.",
          "params": {
            "element": {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element {type, ...}."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "The added element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addCustomElement": {
          "desc": "Adds a custom element managed by your own functions.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "getNewFunction": {
              "type": "function|nil",
              "desc": "function(element) -> list {fieldName, value} of default values."
            },
            "setMissionFunction": {
              "type": "function|nil",
              "desc": "function(element, missionTypeData) called when a mission is loaded."
            },
            "drawFunction": {
              "type": "function|nil",
              "desc": "function(element, missionTypeData, mission, mouseInfo) -> true if the value changed."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addNumeric": {
          "desc": "Numeric (float) field; default 0.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "fieldName": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Key in missionTypeData."
            },
            "defaultValue": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Default value."
            },
            "displayOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Display options (optional, associatedStars...)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addString": {
          "desc": "Text field (1024-character buffer by default); default empty string.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "fieldName": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Key in missionTypeData."
            },
            "defaultValue": {
              "type": "string|nil",
              "desc": "Default value."
            },
            "len": {
              "type": "integer|nil",
              "desc": "Buffer size."
            },
            "displayOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Display options."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addBool": {
          "desc": "Checkbox; default false. If hideElementList is given, these elements are moved right after it and hidden when the checkbox is unchecked.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "fieldName": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Key in missionTypeData."
            },
            "defaultValue": {
              "type": "boolean|nil",
              "desc": "Default value."
            },
            "hideElementList": {
              "type": "table[]|nil",
              "desc": "Elements to display only when the checkbox is checked."
            },
            "displayOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Display options."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addTransform": {
          "desc": "Position / rotation / scale editable in the 3D world (transformUtil gizmo). Stored in <fieldName>Pos, <fieldName>Rot, <fieldName>Scl.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "fieldName": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Key prefix."
            },
            "valueOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "{defaultPos, defaultRot, defaultScl, hasPos, hasRot, hasScl, oneDimScale}."
            },
            "displayOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "{drawMode='sphere'|'vehicle'|'sphereDir'|'halfBox'|'fullBox', drawColor={r,g,b,a}, ...}."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addModelConfig": {
          "desc": "Vehicle choice (model + configuration). Default: model \"sbr\", config \"TT_RWD_S_M\". Stored in <fieldName>Model / Config / ConfigPath.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "fieldName": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Key prefix."
            },
            "defaultModel": {
              "type": "string|nil",
              "desc": "Default model."
            },
            "defaultConfig": {
              "type": "string|nil",
              "desc": "Default config."
            },
            "displayOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Display options."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addFile": {
          "desc": "File path with file selector.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "fieldName": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Key in missionTypeData."
            },
            "defaultValue": {
              "type": "string|nil",
              "desc": "Default path."
            },
            "allowedExtensions": {
              "type": "table[]|nil",
              "desc": "List of {description, pattern} pairs, e.g. {\"Sites File\",\"*.sites.json\"}."
            },
            "displayOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Options (optional: the file is then not checked)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addFixedFile": {
          "desc": "File expected at a fixed name in the mission folder (a string, or a list of which one of the files is required). Stores no value.",
          "params": {
            "label": {
              "type": "string",
              "desc": "Label."
            },
            "filepathsInMissionfolder": {
              "type": "string|string[]",
              "desc": "File name(s)."
            },
            "displayOptions": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Display options."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Element."
            }
          ]
        },
        "addRace": {
          "desc": "Race file (addFile filtered on *.path.json) of type \"race\".",
